@startuml Sequence_Diagram
title Hospital System - Patient Visit Flow

skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam ParticipantPadding 20
skinparam BoxPadding 10
skinparam SequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam sequence {
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #EEF4FF
  ParticipantBorderColor #4A90D9
  ParticipantFontStyle bold
  ArrowColor #333333
  LifeLineBorderColor #4A90D9
  NoteBackgroundColor #FFFDE7
  NoteBorderColor #F9A825
}

participant "Receptionist" as R
participant "Doctor"        as D
participant "Lab Tech"      as L
participant "Cashier"       as C
participant "API"           as API
database    "Database"      as DB

== 1 - تسجيل المريض ==

R  -> API : POST /patients
API -> DB : INSERT Patient
DB --> API : patient id=1
API --> R  : 201 Created

== 2 - حجز موعد ==

R  -> API : POST /appointments
API -> DB : INSERT Appointment
DB --> API : appointment id=5
API --> R  : 201 Created

== 3 - الزيارة الطبية ==

D  -> API : POST /visits
API -> DB : INSERT Visit
DB --> API : visit id=10
API --> D  : 201 Created

== 4 - طلب تحليل ==

D  -> API : POST /lab-requests
API -> DB : INSERT LabRequest + LabRequestItem
DB --> API : labRequest id=7
API --> D  : 201 Created (status: PENDING)

== 5 - نتيجة التحليل ==

L  -> API : GET /lab-requests
API -> DB : SELECT WHERE status=PENDING
DB --> API : list
API --> L  : 200 OK

L  -> API : PATCH /lab-requests/7/items/1
note right : resultValue, unit\nreferenceRangeMin, referenceRangeMax
API -> DB : UPDATE LabRequestItem
DB --> API : updated
API --> L  : 200 OK

L  -> API : PATCH /lab-requests/7
note right : status = COMPLETED
API -> DB : UPDATE LabRequest
DB --> API : updated
API --> L  : 200 OK

== 6 - انشاء الفاتورة ==

C  -> API : POST /invoices
API -> DB : INSERT Invoice
DB --> API : invoice id=20
API --> C  : 201 Created

C  -> API : POST /invoices/20/items
note right : itemType=LAB, referenceId=7, unitPrice=50
API -> DB : INSERT InvoiceItem
DB --> API : updated
API --> C  : 201 Created

C  -> API : POST /invoices/20/items
note right : itemType=CONSULTATION, unitPrice=100
API -> DB : INSERT InvoiceItem
DB --> API : updated
API --> C  : 201 Created

== 7 - تحصيل الفاتورة ==

C  -> API : PATCH /invoices/20
note right : status=PAID, discount=10
API -> DB : UPDATE Invoice SET finalAmount=140
DB --> API : updated
API --> C  : 200 OK - finalAmount: 140

@enduml
